<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling steady on dlr, gains on pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling steady on dlr, gains on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling was unchanged against the dollar but gained against the pound on Wednesday, the central Bank of Tanzania said.</p>
<p>Against the dollar, the shilling exchanged at an unchanged commercial mean rate of 625.6800. It was quoted at a mean of 1036.4990 to the pound from 1056.4638 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
